## Public-Beta Blockers (external-clone gate)

| id | title | severity | domain | effort | depends_on | fix_summary |
|----|-------|----------|--------|--------|------------|-------------|
| BETA-INSTALL-01 | Committed `.mcp.json` hardcodes a machine-specific absolute task-orchestrator path (`/Users/hue/plugins/...`) with no installer rewrite — dead MCP on every non-author clone | HIGH | Install | S | — | Any external user cloning the repo gets a task-orchestrator MCP server pointing at a script that does not exist on their machine → the orchestrator MCP silently fails to start. Replace the absolute path with a repo-relative launcher (e.g. `./scripts/...`) or have install.sh generate the `.mcp.json` command per-machine. This is a first-touch install blocker for public beta. Re-raised against this HEAD because the prior REFUTED label carried no evidence. |
| BETA-MCP-02 | compose.yml uses `condition: service_started` (bare-list depends_on) for ConPort, task-orchestrator, adhd-engine — cold-start connection-refused races | MED | MCP | S | — | On a cold `docker compose up`, ConPort starts before Postgres/Redis accept connections, and task-orchestrator/adhd-engine start before ConPort is healthy → intermittent crash loops (masked by `restart: unless-stopped` but adds churn and first-run flakiness for new users). Convert these bare-list depends_on entries to long-form with `condition: service_healthy`, mirroring the dopecon-bridge/dope-memory blocks already in the file. |
| BETA-MCP-03 | No per-instance Redis isolation: instance overlay never remaps redis-primary, and ADHD-engine state keys are user-scoped only — two same-user worktrees collide | MED | MCP | M | — | In the exact dogfood scenario (one user running 2+ worktrees), ADHD state — attention state, last-break timestamp, energy profile — is shared across instances because keys carry only user_id, and there is no per-instance Redis. Cross-instance state bleed corrupts break timing and attention-aware limits. Namespace the keys with workspace_id/instance_id (preferred, cheap) or fork a per-instance redis-primary in the overlay. Public-beta multi-instance safety item. |

